From 2528e295a8293ccba4212fa2ad7c185d01799b9a Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: nags <nags@kalaa-bhadra.local>
Date: Sat, 3 Oct 2026 15:47:09 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] fix(security): round-2 audit remediation

- Order pages: replace tautological length check with per-order
  unguessable guestAccessToken (schema: Order.guestAccessToken); token
  issued at checkout, delivered via buyer email + redirect/return URLs.
- Scrub passwordHash from messages (sender) and reviews (author) returns;
  SAFE_USER_SELECT now used at all 5 sites (was dead code); trimmed to
  id/name/image/avatarUrl; admin includes narrowed.
- retryOrderPaymentAction: zod validation, owner-or-token auth, per-order
  + per-IP rate limits, idempotent statuses, earnings booked in sandbox
  path, Cashfree order id recorded; RetryPaymentButton derives SDK mode
  from env and errors when the SDK is missing.
- Webhook: strip _R retry suffix when reconciling; SELECT FOR UPDATE on
  the confirm-time stock re-check (deterministic lock order).
- Checkout: rate limits, refuse existing emails for guest checkout
  (no unverified account binding), deterministic lock order.
- Creator cancel: stock restored, unpaid earnings voided, buyer refund
  email, admin REFUND_REQUIRED alert (flags paid-out clawbacks).
- Fulfillment UI: only valid transitions offered; server errors surfaced.
- Artwork edit now writes images (primary upsert, gallery replace).
- Follows require sign-in (guest bucket removed); button redirects.
- UI: dead footer links removed, terms/privacy back-home, honest
  messaging copy, explore All Works count, search errors surfaced,
  clickable gallery thumbnails, honest studio earnings statuses.
- Photos: totem replaced (verified), terracotta texture replaced
  (verified); seed + repair script updated.
